  "releaseNotes": "v2.1.1 (2026-10-25): patch release with no API changes. A float[] parameter now reaches a VECTOR(n) column as a vector instead of the literal text \"System.Single[]\", and ORDER BY vec_distance_*() LIMIT k now reaches the vector index instead of a full scan. Previous: v2.1.0 (2026-10-10): .NET 11 / C# 15 preview release line — net11.0-only, native Zstandard compression (quality presets 1/5/19 + frame checksum), Runtime Async, an additive C# 15 API surface (SharpCoreDB.Net11), and the Munarium-inspired DiskANN index + content-verified index artifacts. The net10.0 / C# 14 line is the v2.0 stable packages, now parked on release/v2.0. See docs/net11/UPGRADE.md for details.",
